            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İşleyici yalnızca geçersiz koltuk metni bekliyor. Hangi işlem bu gereğinden büyük <code>try</code> bloğunun dışına taşınmalı?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"booking.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  seats = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;seats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = seats * form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  save_booking(total)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Toplam hesaplaması ve <code>save_booking()</code> çağrısı</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>int()</code> ile dönüştürme</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>ValueError</code> işleyicisi</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyon gövdesinin tamamı</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Toplam hesaplaması ve <code>save_booking()</code> çağrısı.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
